sops (Secrets OPerationS) is an editor of encrypted files that supports
YAML, JSON, ENV, INI and BINARY formats and encrypts with AWS KMS, GCP
KMS, Azure Key Vault, HuaweiCloud KMS, HashiCorp Vault, age, and PGP.

This build installs the official statically-linked upstream binary
release; no compiler or Go toolchain is required. Only x86_64 is
supported, since upstream does not publish a 32-bit Linux binary.

To use PGP support you need gnupg. Cloud KMS backends
(AWS/GCP/Azure/HuaweiCloud) and HashiCorp Vault need valid credentials
configured per upstream's documentation;
